@host = http://localhost:5000

###
GET {{host}}/

### Look up a book through the Lending API
# Catalog has it as a Book; the ACL translates it to a LoanableItem.
GET {{host}}/lending/items/9780321125217

### Restricted book (Catalog says IsRestricted=true)
GET {{host}}/lending/items/9780000000001

### Unknown reference
GET {{host}}/lending/items/0000000000000
